  "change_summary": [
    "Preserve the original baseline registration without overwriting its original roadmap digest.",
    "Bind the current amended roadmap and the v1.1 operational measurement contract as later design revisions.",
    "Do not treat a historical digest alone as proof of the unavailable prior document bytes.",
    "Keep specification work separate from source implementation, calibration, release or host closure.",
    "Append finite-formal-v1.2: correct numerical supremum versus outward Q enclosure, adapt K8 internal precision, synchronize JA/EN contracts, and bind cross-platform LF checkout; preserve the prior v1.1 hash.",
    "Append finite-formal-v1.3: state the K8 rational t definition, acosh-to-atanh identity, and 2*atanh(q)/sqrt(kappa) endpoint formula consistently in Japanese and English; preserve the v1.2 snapshot hash.",
    "Correct the v1.2 predecessor digest metadata and validate the existence, order and hash of every measurement revision predecessor.",
    "Reconcile the attached v1.1 math re-audit against current v1.3, preserving already-corrected n_geo/K8 endpoint and uncertainty rules while adding the K4 square interval law, explicit novelty-policy IDs, and G31-G37 regressions in v1.4."
